    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://underthespire.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/web-aaron-comeau.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://underthespire.ca/events-2/island-proud-with-aaron-comeau/?occurrence=2024-07-31"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://underthespire.ca/events-2/island-proud-with-aaron-comeau/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Welcome to Island Proud, where we'll present the best in PEI talent and hospitality! Island Proud features a 45 minute concert followed by a reception in the pavilion with the artist.    Musician, composer, engineer, artist — these labels and many more make up the diverse approaches to sound that Aaron Comeau employs in each of his works. An in-demand session player and studio haunt, he regularly performs with the likes of Skydiggers, Hayden, and Logan Richard, and has appeared on countless recordings, most recently with Carlie Howell, KINLEY, and Nick Doneff. When giving a rare solo performance, Aaron considers all aspects of the environment subject to artistic invention, imbuing every stage with elements of installation work. His official exhibitions at Charlottetown’s Art In The Open in both 2022 and 2023, as well as a two-day solo piano performance at the Beaconsfield Carriage House in May 2023, all featured a variety of interactive visual &amp; auditory stimuli that challenged the traditional boundary between audience &amp; performer. 2024 will see the release of his debut songwriter record, Infinity Trials, in addition to his inaugural performance at the Under The Spire Music Festival, where he serves as technical director.    Click here to find out more!        Musicien, compositeur, ingénieur, artiste - ces qualificatifs et bien d'autres constituent les diverses approches sonores qu'Aaron Comeau emploie dans chacune de ses œuvres. Joueur de studio très demandé, il se produit régulièrement avec des groupes tels que Skydiggers, Hayden et Logan Richard, et a participé à d'innombrables enregistrements, plus récemment avec Carlie Howell, KINLEY et Nick Doneff. Lors de ses rares performances en solo, Aaron considère tous les aspects de l'environnement comme des sujets d'invention artistique, imprégnant chaque étape d'éléments d'installation. Ses expositions officielles au Art In The Open de Charlottetown en 2022 et 2023, ainsi qu'une performance solo de piano de deux jours au Beaconsfield Carriage House en mai 2023, présentaient toutes une variété de stimuli visuels et auditifs interactifs qui remettaient en question la frontière traditionnelle entre le public et l'interprète. L'année 2024 verra la sortie de son premier album de compositeur, Infinity Trials, ainsi que sa première prestation au festival de musique Under The Spire, dont il assure la direction technique.    Cliquez ici pour plus d'information!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Island Proud with Aaron Comeau"
      }
    ],
