    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  Get ready to paint with a purpose with this East Coast Art Party Fundraising event! East Coast Art Party is supporting Under the Spire’s restoration efforts for Historic St. Mary’s on Friday May 30th at 6:30pm!      Join us in the PCU Pavilion at Historic St. Mary’s for an evening of creativity and community. We’ll be painting a beautiful “Summer Lupins” masterpiece, with step-by-step guidance from our export instructors. All supplies will be supplied and absolutely no experience necessary!    Tickets are $45+HST, and $15 from every sale goes directly to the restoration fundraiser  for the cherished landmark. Bring your friends and enjoy the inspiring setting, and help preserve St. Mary’s legacy, one vibrant brushstroke at a time.    The PCU Concession will be open, drinks and snacks will be available for purchase.    Spaces are limited, secure your tickets now for fun night of art and impact!    Event is 19+"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pavilion Paint Night with East Coast Art Party"
      }
    ],
