    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://underthespire.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/photo-post-1-1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://underthespire.ca/events-2/rupawl-doggie-drag-race/?occurrence=2025-07-28"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://underthespire.ca/events-2/rupawl-doggie-drag-race/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "It is FREE to sign up your furry friend. We are ALSO accepting Pet Market Vendors! Interested vendors can email music@underthespire.ca and participate for free.   Join us at the iconic Historic St. Mary’s for RuPAWl’s Doggie Drag Race—a pawsitively dazzling evening of pups, pride, and pup-arazzi moments!  Bring your fabulous four-legged friend and enter them in one (or all!) of our three fabulous runway categories, with treats, prizes, and lots of tail-wagging fun. Whether your dog is serving camp, couture, or just unfiltered charisma, this is their time to shine.  Highlights include:          A dazzling doggie drag runway show        Three themed categories for pups to walk the catwalk        Treats for your dogs &amp; goodies from our local dog market        Prizes, photo ops, and a whole lot of pride!      Our runway categories are:  1.        Pride Paw-sonality.  This category celebrates big personalities, bold attitudes and dogs who know how to werk the runway.  Bring the colour!  This is all about vibrant, over the top, Pride-themed outfits  2.        Dynamic Duos.  This category is perfect for matching costumes with your pet.  Whether you’re twinning with your pup or your dog is your costumed sidekick, this is all about iconic pairings and team looks.  3.        Canine Couture Extravaganza. High fashion hits the paw-walk! This category is for dogs dressed to impress in their most elegant, fierce, and runway-ready looks.  We can't wait to meet you and your furr-bulous friend! If you would like to participate, please sign up through the link provided on the right of your screen. Further event questions can be directed to music@underthespire.ca!"
      }
    ],
